INSERT INTO workweave.knowledge_chunks (chunk_id, organization_id, workspace_id, document_version_id, source_id, parent_chunk_id, section_path, heading, content, chunk_index, source_span, embedding, embedding_model, embedding_dimension, index_generation, metadata, created_at, updated_at, revision, source_section_id) VALUES ('2ca70c16-a1e8-47c4-bd54-2db9058698c0', '00000003-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', '00000003-0000-4000-8000-000000000002', '00000003-0000-4000-8000-000000000971', '00000003-0000-4000-8000-000000000970', NULL, '["Fundamentals"]'::jsonb, 'Rollback', '#### 3.2 Who decides

The engineer proposes; the shift lead decides within the change process. Before proposing, state:

1. The current work item and the procedure version you are following.
2. What is verified (the failing check, its values, the time range).
3. What is missing (for example, no data yet from the gateway provider).
4. The rollback the approved plan describes.

